  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP RoL Access to Justice - Justice sector support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP R&#xe4;ttssektorst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen omfattar st&#xf6;d till UNDP: s omfattande program &quot;St&#xf6;d till     r&#xe4;ttsstaten och tillg&#xe5;ng till r&#xe4;ttslig pr&#xf6;vning f&#xf6;r det palestinska   folket 2009-2012&quot;: Programmkomponenterna &#xe4;r: st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten hos   r&#xe4;ttsstaten institutioner, tilltr&#xe4;de till r&#xe4;ttvisa p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5;, k&#xf6;n och ungdomsbrottslighet, st&#xe4;rkandet av r&#xe4;ttsstatsprincipen            frivilligorganisationer i Gaza, f&#xf6;rtroendet bland intressenter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution comprises support to UNDP&apos;s comprehensive programme  &quot;Supporting the Rule of Law and Access to Justice for the Palestinian People 2009-2012&quot;.The programme components are: strengthening the     capacity of the Rule of Law institutions, Access to Justice at local  level, gender and juvenile justice, strengthening the capacity of     Rule of Law NGOs in Gaza, confidence building among stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
